&lt;img alt="0102010_013.png" src="images/0102010_013.png" style="height: 252px; width: 604px"/&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 16px; line-height: 1; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 16px; line-height: 1; text-align: left"&gt;
&lt;img alt="0102010_014.png" src="images/0102010_014.png" style="height: 281px; width: 599px"/&gt;
